Date: Wed, 14 Jan 2026 09:23:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Set fixed height for payloads section

Changed the min-h-[500px] class to h-[500px] in the payloads section to enforce a fixed height instead of a minimum height.
---
 templates/index.html | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/templates/index.html b/templates/index.html
index ee7f910..7bcb690 100644
--- a/templates/index.html
+++ b/templates/index.html
@@ -106,7 +106,7 @@ <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold opacity-50 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Conne
             </div>
         </section>
 
-        <section class="surface border rounded-2xl p-6 transition-colors duration-300 flex flex-col min-h-[500px]">
+        <section class="surface border rounded-2xl p-6 transition-colors duration-300 flex flex-col h-[500px]">
             <div class="flex flex-col xl:flex-row items-center justify-between mb-6 gap-4">
                 <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Payloads</h3>
                 
